help arrayfun
 <strong>arrayfun</strong> - Apply function to each element of array
    This MATLAB function applies the function func to the elements of A, one
    element at a time.

    Syntax
      B = <strong>arrayfun</strong>(func,A)
      B = <strong>arrayfun</strong>(func,A1,...,An)
      B = <strong>arrayfun</strong>(___,Name,Value)
      [B1,...,Bm] = <strong>arrayfun</strong>(___)

    Input Arguments
      <a href="matlab:web('C:\Program Files\MATLAB\R2024a\help\matlab\ref/arrayfun.html#d126e54353')">func</a> - Function to apply
        function handle
      <a href="matlab:web('C:\Program Files\MATLAB\R2024a\help\matlab\ref/arrayfun.html#d126e54383')">A</a> - Input array
        array

    Name-Value Arguments
      <a href="matlab:web('C:\Program Files\MATLAB\R2024a\help\matlab\ref/arrayfun.html#d126e54483')">UniformOutput</a> - True or false
        true (default) | false
      <a href="matlab:web('C:\Program Files\MATLAB\R2024a\help\matlab\ref/arrayfun.html#d126e54555')">ErrorHandler</a> - Function to catch errors
        function handle

    Output Arguments
      <a href="matlab:web('C:\Program Files\MATLAB\R2024a\help\matlab\ref/arrayfun.html#d126e54622')">B</a> - Output array
        array of any data type | cell array

    Examples
      <a href="matlab:openExample('matlab/ApplyFunctionToFieldOfStructureArrayExample')">Apply Function to Field of Structure Array</a>
      <a href="matlab:openExample('matlab/ApplyFunctionAndReturnArrayOfObjectsExample')">Return Object Array</a>
      <a href="matlab:openExample('matlab/ApplyFunctionAndReturnOutputsInCellArrayExample')">Return Outputs in Cell Array</a>
      <a href="matlab:openExample('matlab/ReturnMultipleOutputsFromStructureArrayExample')">Return Multiple Output Arrays</a>

    See also <a href="matlab:help structfun -displayBanner">structfun</a>, <a href="matlab:help cellfun -displayBanner">cellfun</a>, <a href="matlab:help spfun -displayBanner">spfun</a>, <a href="matlab:help cell2mat -displayBanner">cell2mat</a>, <a href="matlab:help splitapply -displayBanner">splitapply</a>, <a href="matlab:help varfun -displayBanner">varfun</a>,
      <a href="matlab:help rowfun -displayBanner">rowfun</a>, <a href="matlab:help groupsummary -displayBanner">groupsummary</a>

    Introduced in MATLAB before R2006a
    <a href="matlab:doc arrayfun">Documentation for arrayfun</a>
    <a href="matlab:matlab.lang.internal.introspective.overloads.displayOverloads('arrayfun')">Other uses of arrayfun</a>

